.SH "@swc/couter"
.PP
Download counter for swc packages\&.

.PP
This package does not contain any code\&. It is used solely to track number of downloads of npm packages like \fR@swc/core\fP and \fR@next/swc\fP\&. If you are building a huge project using SWC, please consider depending on this package\&. It will not add any code to your bundle, but it will help us determine the number of users of SWC\&.

.PP
Counting is done by npm, just like other packages\&. 
